version 0.9.2
view buck-5v

# TPS5430 5V/3A buck print page. Every net is drawn as wires; GND runs as a bus below the parts
# (the view layer has no ground-symbol primitive). C1.2 drops straight to the bus and crosses the
# VFB wire without a dot: a crossing is not a connection (spec/schematic-view.md §5.1). Ports sit
# on the wires they name.
#
# The buck is module M2 of the board, so the page names the board's flat ids: M2.U1, M2.C2, ...
# (spec/module.md §7).
